                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_7">The Essential Business Smartphone</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p class="lead">Equip your workforce with a reliable, no-nonsense device engineered for everyday business operations.</p><p class="lead">Dressed in our signature Odoo Plum Purple with a classic, highly durable casing, the Odoo Phone SE combines a professional aesthetic with pure utility. Built with a flat, high-contrast display and a streamlined camera array, it’s designed to keep your team connected and focused without the premium overhead. </p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_8">Product Highlights</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_9">Premium Refurbished Quality</h3><p class="lead">Hand-certified, rigorously tested, and meticulously graded by internal technicians to ensure pristine mechanical condition and optimal battery health. </p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_10">Signature Odoo Aesthetic</h3><p class="lead">Custom-finished body panel utilizing a high-durability coating in deep plum for a uniform, sleek corporate look.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_11">Native Ecosystem Integration</h3><p class="lead">Ready out-of-the-box to sync directly with your Odoo Fleet and Employees apps for instant provisioning and remote management.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_12">Eco-Friendly Tech Choice</h3><p class="lead">By choosing a certified refurbished Odoo Phone SE, your company helps reduce electronic waste while keeping your hardware budget lean. </p></div>
                    </section><section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_18">Hardware &amp; Design</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p class="lead">The Odoo Phone 19 is optimized for durability, long shifts, and straightforward communication.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_19">Streamlined Camera Array</h3><p class="lead"> Features a focused rear camera perfect for the Odoo Barcode app and quick document captures, eliminating fragile, unnecessary multi-lens setups.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_20">Endurance Battery</h3><p class="lead">Equipped with an optimized battery cell designed to easily last through full warehouse shifts, delivery routes, or long days in the field.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_21">Classic Form Factor</h3><p class="lead">A robust, comfortable grip with a clean black front bezel that prioritizes readability and ease of use in any working environment.</p></div>
                    </section><section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_26">Technical Specifications</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><table class="table table-bordered o_table"><tbody><tr><td><p class="lead"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">Feature</strong></p></td><td><p class="lead"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">Specification</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Processor</p></td><td><p class="lead">Odoo Silicon M19 (4-Core)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Display</p></td><td><p class="lead">5.8-inch High-Definition LCD</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">RAM</p></td><td><p class="lead">32GB LPDDR4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Camera System</p></td><td><p class="lead">Essential Single-Lens Rear Camera (Barcode Optimized)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Battery Life</p></td><td><p class="lead">Extended capacity offering up to 14 hours of active shift time</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
