f_content_link_depth_1">360° Far-Field Microphones</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_2_18" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_0">Technical Specifications</a></div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-9 s_table_of_content_main oe_structure oe_empty o_colored_level" data-name="Content">
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_2_7" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">The Smart Business Assistant</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p class="lead">
                                <b>Bring voice-activated productivity directly into your office, warehouse, or boardroom.</b></p><p class="lead">Wrapped in a premium acoustic fabric in our signature Deep Plum Purple, the Hellodoo isn't just a smart speaker—it's a hands-free portal to your entire business operations. Designed specifically to integrate seamlessly with the Odoo ecosystem, it allows you to query inventory, schedule meetings, and log CRM notes without ever opening your laptop.   </p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_2_10" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Key Innovations</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_2_11"><span class="h5-fs">Native Odoo Voice Integration</span><br></h3><p class="lead">
                                Ask Hellodoo for real-time sales figures, stock availability, or the status of a manufacturing order, and get instant, accurate readouts straight from your database. 
                            </p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_2_12">Voice-to-CRM Logging</h3><p class="lead">
                                Dictate meeting notes, update lead statuses, or log a call summary directly into a client's file while your hands are busy.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_2_8"><span class="h5-fs">Meeting Room Concierge</span><br></h3><p class="lead">
                                Place a Hellodoo in your conference room to voice-control connected IoT devices, adjust presentation lighting, or automatically book the room in the Odoo Calendar. </p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_2_9">Enterprise Privacy Mode</h3><p class="lead"> Unlike consumer smart speakers, Hellodoo processes business commands securely. A dedicated hardware mute button ensures complete confidentiality during sensitive discussions. </p></div>
                    </section><section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_2_16" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Acoustic &amp; Hardware Design</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_11" class="lead">The Hellodoo balances elegant minimalism with high-end audio engineering, perfect for any professional setting.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_2_15"><span class="h5-fs">Signature Odoo Aesthetic</span><br></h3><p class="lead">
                                The acoustic mesh is dyed in a precise Deep Plum Purple, ensuring it perfectly complements your corporate branding and workspace. </p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_2_17">Matte White Controls</h3><p class="lead"> Clean, tactile matte white buttons on the top panel provide instant, reliable access to volume controls, microphone muting, and manual activation.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_2_13"><span class="h5-fs">360° Far-Field Microphones</span><br></h3><p class="lead"> An advanced 6-mic array with background noise cancellation ensures your voice commands are picked up clearly, even from across a busy warehouse or a large boardroom.</p></div>
                    </section><section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_2_18" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Technical Specifications</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><table class="table table-bordered o_table"><tbody><tr style="height: 56.7969px;"><td><p class="lead"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">Feature</strong></p></td><td><p class="lead"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">Specification</strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 82.7969px;"><td><p class="lead">Color Profile</p></td><td><p class="lead">Odoo Plum Purple Casing / Matte White Buttons</p></td></tr><tr style="height: 65.4176px;"><td><p class="lead">Audio Output</p></td><td><p class="lead">360° High-Fidelity Neodymium Speaker</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Microphone System</p></td><td><p class="lead">6-Mic Far-Field Array with Active Noise Cancellation</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Connectivity</p></td><td><p class="lead">Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, Native Odoo IoT Box protocol</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Privacy Features</p></td><td><p class="lead">Hardware Microphone Disconnect Switch</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>]]></field>
    <field name="description_ecommerce"><![CDATA[<p>Transform the way your team interacts with their data. Whether it's a quick inventory check on the warehouse floor, setting a timer in the breakroom, or pulling up daily KPIs during a morning stand-up, Hellodoo bridges the gap between your physical workspace and your digital ERP.</p><p><b>Give your business a voice. Deploy Hellodoo in your workspace today.</b></p>]]></field>
