                    <div class="s_table_of_content_navbar list-group o_no_link_popover" style="top: 76px; max-height: calc(-96px + 100vh);"><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_7" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_0">The Ultimate Corporate Gaming Console</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_8" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_0">Product Highlights</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_9" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Premium Refurbished Quality</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_10" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Dual-Tone Odoo Aesthetic</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_11" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Ready-to-Play Bundle</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_12" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Eco-Friendly Tech Choice</a></div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-9 s_table_of_content_main oe_structure oe_empty o_colored_level" data-name="Content">
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_7">The Ultimate Corporate Gaming Console</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p class="lead"><b>Bring your team together or reward your top performers with a console engineered for the modern tech enthusiast.</b></p><p class="lead">Dressed in a striking contrast of signature Odoo Plum Purple and sleek matte white, the Nintodoo Switch combines professional brand aesthetic with pure entertainment. Built with a stunning black screen and crisp white Joy-Cons, it’s designed to fit right into modern workspaces, lounge areas, or the hands of your valued clients.  </p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_8">Product Highlights</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_9">Premium Refurbished Quality</h3><p class="lead">Hand-certified, rigorously tested, and meticulously graded by internal technicians to ensure pristine mechanical and cosmetic condition. </p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_10">Dual-Tone Odoo Aesthetic</h3><p class="lead">Custom-finished body panel utilizing high-durability coating in deep plum paired with clean, contrasting matte white controllers. </p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_11">Ready-to-Play Bundle</h3><p class="lead">Ships with a complete peripheral package, fully sanitized and securely packed with fresh accessories. </p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_12">Eco-Friendly Tech Choice</h3><p class="lead">By choosing a certified refurbished Nintodoo Switch, your company helps reduce electronic waste while enjoying a premium hardware experience.</p></div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>]]></field>
    <field name="description_ecommerce"><![CDATA[<p>Elevate your company culture. The Nintodoo Switch is a fantastic tool for casual networking, breaking the ice during corporate retreats, or setting up a dedicated relaxation zone in the office to spark creativity and collaboration.</p><p><b>Give your workspace a touch of fun. Add the Nintodoo Switch to your inventory today.</b></p>]]></field>
